{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Perfect Cut</i>, your goal is to slice various aliments such as bananas, carrots, toast, and apples. The challenge? Cut each item to match the exact target and make <strong>Perfect Cut</strong>. Precision is key!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Mode :</strong> How long can you maintain your precision? Keep cutting, make perfect combo, and become the top player in this classic arcade mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Daily Challenges:</strong> Every day brings a new challenge with its own set of rules, such as making only perfect cuts or slicing foods quickly before the timer runs out. Daily Cut schedule :</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Monday:</strong> Caffeinated!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tuesday:</strong> Timed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wednesday:</strong> Rotation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thursday:</strong> Full Precision</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Friday:</strong> Verticality !</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Saturday:</strong> Only Perfect</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sunday:</strong> Automatic Move</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leaderboards:</strong> Compete with players around the world and climb the ranks to become the <i>Perfect Cutter</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Secret Mode </strong>: ??? you can unlock this mode by scoring over 3,000 points in any mode ( Go unlock it, it's really cool! )</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4131820?t=1762008982","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4131820?t=1762008982","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131820/42247deba310b20de4453a7baca718903062b908/capsule_23